    "body": "(10 points) Let $\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 5\\end{array}\\right], \\boldsymbol{v}_{2}=\\left[\\begin{array}{c}3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 4\\end{array}\\right]$ and $\\boldsymbol{x}=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 6\\end{array}\\right]$, and $\\boldsymbol{B}=\\left\\{\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}, \\boldsymbol{v}_{2}\\right\\}$. Then $\\boldsymbol{B}$ is a basis for $H=\\operatorname{span}\\left\\{\\boldsymbol{v}_{1}, \\boldsymbol{v}_{2}\\right\\}$. Determine if $\\boldsymbol{x}$ is in $H$, and if it is, find the coordinate vector of $\\boldsymbol{x}$ relative to $\\boldsymbol{B}$.",
